    <string name="privacy_page_headline">Ubumfihlo bakho bubalulekile kithi</string>
    <string name="privacy_page_body">I-Loan EMI igcina umlando wezibalo zakho nezintandokazi zakho kudivayisi yakho. Singasebenzisa izinsizakalo zokukhangisa nezaziso ukuze sithuthukise ulwazi lokusebenzisa uhlelo lokusebenza.\n\nAsiceli imininingwane yokungena ebhange lakho, imininingwane yekhadi noma iphasiwedi ye-akhawunti yakho.\n\nThepha inkinobho engezansi ukuze ufunde Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo ephelele.</string>
    <string name="terms_page_headline">Sicela ubuyekeze imigomo yethu</string>
    <string name="terms_page_body">Ngokusebenzisa i-Loan EMI, uyavuma ukusebenzisa izibali ngezinjongo zokuthola ulwazi kuphela. Imiphumela iyizilinganiso futhi ingahluka ezinombolweni zangempela zamabhange noma zababolekisi.\n\nUhlelo lokusebenza lunikezwa njengoba lunjalo, ngaphandle kwesiqinisekiso seseluleko sezezimali.\n\nThepha inkinobho engezansi ukuze ufunde yonke Imigomo Nemibandela.</string>
